rap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#16181D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="770" width="370" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v166" value="• order_items keeps &lt;i&gt;name_snapshot&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;unit_price&lt;/i&gt; so past bills never change when a menu price changes.&lt;br&gt;• orders.status: PLACED → CONFIRMED → PREPARING → OUT_FOR_DELIVERY → DELIVERED, or CANCELLED.&lt;br&gt;• Deleting a restaurant cascades to its menu_items; deleting an order cascades to its order_items." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="800" width="410" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>